  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n30 - [40 - {56 - (25 - 13 - 12)}] = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBODMAS Rule\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n30 - [40 - {56 - (25 - 13 - 12)}]\n\n⇒ 30 - [40 - {56 - (12 - 12)}]\n\n⇒ 30 - [40 - {56 - 0}]\n\n⇒ 30 - [40 - 56]\n\n⇒ 30 - (-16)\n\n⇒ 30 + 16\n\n⇒ 46\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
